Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:54:08 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] low ram: shorter keep times for host caches under
 VICTORY_LOW_RAM

VICTORY_LOW_RAM (new module low_ram: on with 24 GiB of RAM or less,
VICTORY_LOW_RAM=0 turns it off, =1 on) makes the card-texture and
system-RAM caches keep what they hold for 15 s instead of 10 minutes
(vram_keep, vram_idle_for) and 5 minutes (ram_idle_for).

Cost: copies made again and uploaded again more often. Off above 24 GiB.
Disable this cut alone with VICTORY_LOW_RAM=0.
